<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:19Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>US President Donald Trump says deportation policy was 'too tough' for voters</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:04287db8b6d62f81c5fe84b15be87c046c1922304daa959fb6309a6a74688f64</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:01Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T06:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-president-donald-trump-says-deportation-policy-was-too-tough-for-voters/a-79895321--f5ff91bb147c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-president-donald-trump-says-deportation-policy-was-too-tough-for-voters/a-79895321?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump said his deportation policy may be one of the reasons the Republicans lost so much ground in the midterm elections.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>G7 ministers meet as Europe seeks greater say in Ukraine peace talks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:96dd129d4508b1ceec4c2e41d6a991b78c07312994f7ab38986a12c7bf8564e1</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:04Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T04:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/g7-ministers-meet-as-europe-seeks-greater-say-in-ukraine-peace-talks/a-79894960--9d193fcd2a73.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/g7-ministers-meet-as-europe-seeks-greater-say-in-ukraine-peace-talks/a-79894960?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With Washington preparing negotiations with Moscow and Kyiv, European leaders fear Ukraine could face pressure to accept a bad deal. Iran tensions and the threat of renewed US strikes are also on the agenda.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pope Leo urges Argentina's Milei to put people before the economy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b3cc80be661a4fd0d1258e3403c1e34ceaf90db6761cfdad3740ff38c298ca72</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:07Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T01:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-urges-argentina-s-milei-to-put-people-before-the-economy/a-79894779--05e1c03ee5a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pope-leo-urges-argentina-s-milei-to-put-people-before-the-economy/a-79894779?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pope Leo XIV has urged Argentina to protect democracy and ensure economic growth benefits the poor, delivering a message to President Javier Milei over austerity, social welfare and political divisions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia CEO Huang admits affair amid rumors of China spy ties</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c7de3fc18cd5ee81c5ecb8f75ee7f0939e3cc8eedfd5a0555a00864435976af7</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:10Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T23:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747--d2ac9a59ebd3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-ceo-huang-admits-affair-amid-rumors-of-china-spy-ties/a-79894747?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Following reports of Nvidia's chief Jensen Huang becoming involved with a Chinese spy, Huang offered an apology for cheating on his wife. Meanwhile, the US tech company pledged to investigate the alleged espionage.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran: Trump says strikes unlikely if peace talks keep moving</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ad1e537b554a45aba5d9865e21a00e20e0bd99b9d828813443c7042379e119e7</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T20:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-trump-says-strikes-unlikely-if-peace-talks-keep-moving/a-79894190--b3134d212c00.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-trump-says-strikes-unlikely-if-peace-talks-keep-moving/a-79894190?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">After weeks of rumors that the US and Israel were preparing new strikes on Iran, President Donald Trump said it was "highly unlikely" that he would order a new escalation as the Iranians "want to make a deal so badly."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany: Chancellor Merz to nominate Aigner for president</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7cee3484d29cceb84b6903bd9b1a1592759e64570c86eba4a4c48fbc3e62a4ad</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T19:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-chancellor-merz-to-nominate-aigner-for-president/live-79883533--d347f58eed72.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-chancellor-merz-to-nominate-aigner-for-president/live-79883533?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German Chancellor Friedrich Merz announced that he will nominate Ilse Aigner for federal president, paving the way for her to be the first woman to hold the office. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Many killed after migrant boat sinks off Senegal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1fdc576d7293d31e562fb018b2e45ded45207cab53cae88912f63ec22aa8c665</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:55:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T19:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/many-killed-after-migrant-boat-sinks-off-senegal/a-79890883--2975c49621fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/many-killed-after-migrant-boat-sinks-off-senegal/a-79890883?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The incident occurred near Kebemer off the coast of northwestern Senegal. Authorities on El Hierro in the Canary Islands have declared an emergency after a marked increase in migrant boat arrivals.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Africa elections: ANC marks its worst-ever performance</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf4bf1c5a15f3e9cf19c4f0d02fc651144a46d5e8c004e89dc36258b4aaf2ea4</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T17:35:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-africa-elections-anc-marks-its-worst-ever-performance/a-79887482--98e867ce01e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-africa-elections-anc-marks-its-worst-ever-performance/a-79887482?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The African National Congress, the party of late Nobel Prize winner Nelson Mandela, slumped to its worst-ever result in South Africa's municipal election. The voters blame the ANC for water and electricity shortages.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Egypt train crash leaves several dead, over 100 injured</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:59d3b86b368d9e1b0512cd599f6c26f5e2f2664a174ee7c0a23a2f018a40193c</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T16:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/egypt-train-crash-leaves-several-dead-over-100-injured/a-79892916--0936ecd1e565.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/egypt-train-crash-leaves-several-dead-over-100-injured/a-79892916?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A train derailed after colliding with another train south of Cairo, with authorities confirming several deaths and saying more than 100 passengers were injured. Over 50 ambulances were deployed to the scene.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Israel: Eisenkot officially tasked with forming a government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:01e374bce7f46d540995bf9115e9f6cb9c901e8d4700cb96c7c9e250a4b6eb0e</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T15:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israel-eisenkot-officially-tasked-with-forming-a-government/a-79891422--47e8dba46615.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israel-eisenkot-officially-tasked-with-forming-a-government/a-79891422?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Israeli President Isaac Herzog tasked Gadi Eisenkot with the right of trying to form a government. The opposition leader's way to replacing Benjamin Netanyahu as prime minister is full of political challenges.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran: US strikes ship after Hormuz blockade breach</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b26de3d73cd2ea326ddd4a8dc4f3f423c4f3c8e7ac1423b2cbd16842c1b40844</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T13:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-us-strikes-ship-after-hormuz-blockade-breach/a-79890434--13b5e59a0bc3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-us-strikes-ship-after-hormuz-blockade-breach/a-79890434?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US military said a vessel trying to leave an Iranian port was hit due to the naval blockade on the country. On its part, Iran said three "non compliant" oil tankers caught fire in the Strait of Hormuz.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Gaza: Rains add misery to humanitarian catastrophe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6a1b1e108a09fe4fa7562590ad7d5c5959add1c09fef5879e4d2a4a7a579b005</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T10:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/gaza-rains-add-misery-to-humanitarian-catastrophe/a-79889580--aadff38d36aa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/gaza-rains-add-misery-to-humanitarian-catastrophe/a-79889580?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">With most homes damaged or destroyed by the war, Gazans are facing worsening humanitarian conditions due to heavy rain.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Never Again!': Holocaust remembrance under pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:79ea61860e9e8ea9db7ffb2f32d19d725a393df96a91541f5e6af2423081a00f</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T09:54:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/never-again-holocaust-remembrance-under-pressure/a-79840894--861f4756e8c3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/never-again-holocaust-remembrance-under-pressure/a-79840894?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Only a few Holocaust survivors remain who can share their stories firsthand. Meanwhile, voices calling for an end to what they describe as a "cult of guilt" are growing louder. How can Holocaust remembrance survive?</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Poland begins two days of mourning over Krakow shooting</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bbbd387a71139fbaf2a9ab06f3119352414a14c4156a687c6da6080f2c1da4d6</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T09:43:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-begins-two-days-of-mourning-over-krakow-shooting/a-79889400--0eccdd37b487.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-begins-two-days-of-mourning-over-krakow-shooting/a-79889400?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Polish authorities have opened a terror probe after the shooting on Krakow's Main Square. Police confirmed that the bodies found at the suspect's home were those of his parents and sister.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: Delhi chokes on most polluted Diwali eve in 10 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fb65fc8d976252317a0142962924074d7df84f2a616576c9d0f173e0d826ea74</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T07:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-chokes-on-most-polluted-diwali-eve-in-10-years/live-79883248--b4ed1b7f6c06.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-delhi-chokes-on-most-polluted-diwali-eve-in-10-years/live-79883248?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Delhi was ranked as the world's most polluted major city on the eve of Diwali. Delhi's air pollution is expected to get worse in the coming days.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>As COP31 Antalya kicks off, can world move beyond big promises?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:519430a953716ed979bfb04046be32b07488259232d14f75bb474a5a819d48f5</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T05:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/as-cop31-antalya-kicks-off-can-world-move-beyond-big-promises/a-79661366--3ff0bee69cef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/as-cop31-antalya-kicks-off-can-world-move-beyond-big-promises/a-79661366?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Droughts, floods and extreme heat are upping the pressure on delegates at the UN climate talks in Antalya, Turkey. Can countries move beyond pledges to concrete action?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Poland: Gunman kills 6 in Krakow main square, police say</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:476b1e1d0eddf3f3d0f02ee39f4ab2f4fc0958f47b12c2ebac023b08a8be6f88</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T21:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/poland-gunman-kills-6-in-krakow-main-square/a-79886489--2e26ae8c4338.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/poland-gunman-kills-6-in-krakow-main-square-police-say/a-79886489?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A suspect who fired from a car killed at least six people, including a British tourist, in Krakow's main market square. Officials said the man was fascinated with "radical" and "far-right" ideologies.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ebola: Why is there still no vaccine?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:59476f09b8aa478ba7519bcf4f5dea5f6037071fadb3c826521bb99cf4b42f0c</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T21:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ebola-why-is-there-still-no-vaccine/a-79888134--134cc892a91f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ebola-why-is-there-still-no-vaccine/a-79888134?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Ebola has been known about for decades, but there is still no vaccine against the Bundibugyo strain of the virus causing the current outbreak. New research raises hopes of protection against the various types of Ebola.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Israeli president tasks Gadi Eisenkot with forming government</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:59ee9196c37c69bed1627aa8bfb5d97f2e479b28683ec11989c3c25b2c9a880d</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T19:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/israeli-president-tasks-gadi-eisenkot-with-forming-government/a-79888288--1dfc2b75eb80.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/israeli-president-tasks-gadi-eisenkot-with-forming-government/a-79888288?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">President Isaac Herzog has picked former Israeli military chief Gadi Eisenkot, leader of an anti-Netanyahu alliance, to take the first shot at trying to form a government. Tricky coalition talks are expected.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Trump offers White House press secretary role to Dana White</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7eb5fe07e9a4f810e1e1ed7512cd584e0d15a93f05d999ab460d5c9fc6ff9e11</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T19:46:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trump-offers-white-house-press-secretary-role-to-dana-white/a-79888119--34dff2f985d0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trump-offers-white-house-press-secretary-role-to-dana-white/a-79888119?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump has offered the White House press secretary job to Dana White, the chief executive of the Ultimate Fighting Championship. White has neither formally accepted nor turned down the invitation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France sees new round of Yellow Vest, student protests</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:46e4d8e50bf4b518883cc64b3587d4698906832113e5efc9fa4c1b654a05e162</id><updated>2026-11-09T06:54:03Z</updated><published>2026-11-07T19:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-sees-new-round-of-yellow-vest-student-protests/a-79884064--3a9e4c3fcc71.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-sees-new-round-of-yellow-vest-student-protests/a-79884064?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Although fewer protesters turned out in comparison with previous weeks, several cities saw clashes between police and demonstrators.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
